# LuminOS live image package set.
#
# Pinned by snapshot, not by version string: archiso has no per-package version
# syntax here, so reproducibility comes from pacman.conf pointing at the frozen
# Arch Linux Archive snapshot named in ../pin.env. Adding a package to this file
# is therefore safe; it resolves against that snapshot, not against today.
#
# Inclusion bar: needed to run the installer, or needed on first boot. Anything
# that is merely nice to have costs ISO size and build minutes.
#
# Verify every entry still exists before committing a change:
#   ./scripts/verify-packages.sh

### Base + kernel ###
base
linux
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-marvell
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
sof-firmware

### Bootloaders (installed into the target by the installer, and used by us) ###
